    "description": "<p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a></i> </p><p><i>A creature or character that takes Fire damage also catches on Fire. When clothing or objects catch Fire, they continue to burn and take Fire damage.</i> </p><h2><span id=\"Fire_Statistics_.28CL_3.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fire_Statistics_(CL_3)\">Fire Statistics (CL 3)</span></h2><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Keywords\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Keywords\">Keywords</a>:</b>&nbsp;Artificial or Natural, Fire </p><p><b>Trigger:</b> A creature, Droid, or object takes Fire damage. </p><p><b>Attack:</b> +5 vs <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> </p><p><b>Recurrence:</b> Each round at the start of the target's turn, until the flames are extinguished. A creature can put out the flames as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a>. </p>",
